      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "loadbalancer chooses the chatsever\nto that has the least websocket connections",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "loadbalancer chooses the chatsever\nto that has the least websocket connections",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1xE2-xt836BtUgzS0lAoV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 622.6306073541933,
      "y": 157.80174281054732,
      "width": 937.7192993164062,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "am",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 810007642,
      "version": 852,
      "versionNonce": 851954502,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781428993958,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "chat servers need to communicate right ?\nbecause other users might not be on the same server \nser couuld use some sort of pubsub using kafka to do that ?\nbut creating that many topics is something no okay in kafka\nfix is to use something like zookeeper to get the info about \nthe configureatio n\nbut it has a scaling prbolem maintaining so many connection and when the no of servers increase\nwe will have to move the users ---> standard issue that is there in the consistent hashng\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "chat servers need to communicate right ?\nbecause other users might not be on the same server \nser couuld use some sort of pubsub using kafka to do that ?\nbut creating that many topics is something no okay in kafka\nfix is to use something like zookeeper to get the info about \nthe configureatio n\nbut it has a scaling prbolem maintaining so many connection and when the no of servers increase\nwe will have to move the users ---> standard issue that is there in the consistent hashng\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
